WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From tabletop, slide one arm under the body, palm up.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Rest the side of the head and shoulder on the mat.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep hips lifted or settle toward the heels.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe and soften.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Slowly press up and switch.
